{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02395","headline":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 十八 · 韦渠牟","name":"杂歌谣辞 步虚词 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫府与玄洲，谁来物外游。\n无烦骑白鹿，不用驾青牛。\n金化颜应驻，云飞鬓不秋。\n仍闻碧海上，更用玉爲楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦渠牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}